\"><a class=\"wk-btn\" href=\"{{p:picker}}\">今天吃什么？</a><a class=\"wk-btn o\" href=\"{{p:recipes}}\">Browse recipes</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"wk-plate\"><div class=\"wk-steam\"><i style=\"--d:0s\"></i><i style=\"--d:.8s\"></i><i style=\"--d:1.6s\"></i></div><div class=\"ring\"></div><div class=\"dish\"></div><span class=\"tag\">麻婆</span></div></section>\n<section class=\"wk-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"wk-h\"><h2>This week</h2><span>本周</span></div><div class=\"wk-grid\"><a class=\"wk-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\" data-t=\"25\" data-r=\"Sichuan\"><div class=\"pic\" style=\"--c1:#c8372d;--c2:#2b1d16;--x:30%;--y:28%\"></div><span class=\"zh\">麻婆豆腐</span><h3>Mapo tofu</h3><span class=\"m\">25 min · Sichuan</span></a><a class=\"wk-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\" data-t=\"15\" data-r=\"Home\"><div class=\"pic\" style=\"--c1:#e8553d;--c2:#f2c94c;--x:43%;--y:45%\"></div><span class=\"zh\">番茄炒蛋</span><h3>Tomato & egg stir-fry</h3><span class=\"m\">15 min · Home</span></a><a class=\"wk-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\" data-t=\"90\" data-r=\"Shanghai\"><div class=\"pic\" style=\"--c1:#8a3b1f;--c2:#2b1d16;--x:56%;--y:32%\"></div><span class=\"zh\">红烧肉</span><h3>Red-braised pork belly</h3><span class=\"m\">90 min · Shanghai</span></a><a class=\"wk-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\" data-t=\"30\" data-r=\"Sichuan\"><div class=\"pic\" style=\"--c1:#c8372d;--c2:#b8873a;--x:69%;--y:49%\"></div><span class=\"zh\">宫保鸡丁</span><h3>Kung pao chicken</h3><span class=\"m\">30 min · Sichuan</span></a></div><p style=\"margin-top:30px\"><a class=\"wk-btn o\" href=\"{{p:recipes}}\">All recipes</a></p></section>\n<section class=\"wk-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"wk-h\"><h2>Three habits</h2><span>三件事</span></div><div class=\"wk-tech\"><div><span class=\"zh\">火</span><h3>Heat first</h3><p>Preheat the wok until it just smokes, then add oil. Most stir-fry mistakes start here.</p></div><div><span class=\"zh\">备</span><h3>Prep everything</h3><p>The cooking takes four minutes. Chop and measure before you light the stove.</p></div><div><span class=\"zh\">味</span><h3>Taste at the end</h3><p>Salt, sugar, vinegar, one more pinch. Adjust in the last ten seconds.</p></div></div></section>","recipes":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>All recipes</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);font-weight:400\">All recipes · 菜谱</h1><p class=\"lead\">Eight dependable dishes. More every Sunday.</p></div></section><section class=\"wk-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"wk-chips\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Filter by time\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" data-f=\"all\">All</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-f=\"quick\">Under 30 min</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-f=\"Sichuan\">Sichuan</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-f=\"Home\">Home style</button></div><div class=\"wk-grid\"><a class=\"wk-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\" data-t=\"25\" data-r=\"Sichuan\"><div class=\"pic\" style=\"--c1:#c8372d;--c2:#2b1d16;--x:30%;--y:28%\"></div><span class=\"zh\">麻婆豆腐</span><h3>Mapo tofu</h3><span class=\"m\">25 min · Sichuan</span></a><a class=\"wk-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\" data-t=\"15\" data-r=\"Home\"><div class=\"pic\" style=\"--c1:#e8553d;--c2:#f2c94c;--x:43%;--y:45%\"></div><span class=\"zh\">番茄炒蛋</span><h3>Tomato & egg stir-fry</h3><span class=\"m\">15 min · Home</span></a><a class=\"wk-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\" data-t=\"90\" data-r=\"Shanghai\"><div class=\"pic\" style=\"--c1:#8a3b1f;--c2:#2b1d16;--x:56%;--y:32%\"></div><span class=\"zh\">红烧肉</span><h3>Red-braised pork belly</h3><span class=\"m\">90 min · Shanghai</span></a><a class=\"wk-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\" data-t=\"30\" data-r=\"Sichuan\"><div class=\"pic\" style=\"--c1:#c8372d;--c2:#b8873a;--x:69%;--y:49%\"></div><span class=\"zh\">宫保鸡丁</span><h3>Kung pao chicken</h3><span class=\"m\">30 min · Sichuan</span></a><a class=\"wk-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\" data-t=\"20\" data-r=\"Cantonese\"><div class=\"pic\" style=\"--c1:#4f7f6f;--c2:#e9e1cc;--x:42%;--y:36%\"></div><span class=\"zh\">清蒸鱼</span><h3>Steamed whole fish</h3><span class=\"m\">20 min · Cantonese</span></a><a class=\"wk-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\" data-t=\"10\" data-r=\"Home\"><div class=\"pic\" style=\"--c1:#4f7f6f;--c2:#e8f0c8;--x:55%;--y:53%\"></div><span class=\"zh\">蒜蓉炒青菜</span><h3>Garlic greens</h3><span class=\"m\">10 min · Home</span></a><a class=\"wk-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\" data-t=\"20\" data-r=\"Jiangnan\"><div class=\"pic\" style=\"--c1:#f2c94c;--c2:#c8372d;--x:68%;--y:40%\"></div><span class=\"zh\">扬州炒饭</span><h3>Yangzhou fried rice</h3><span class=\"m\">20 min · Jiangnan</span></a><a class=\"wk-card\" href=\"{{p:recipe}}\" data-t=\"30\" data-r=\"Sichuan\"><div class=\"pic\" style=\"--c1:#a02a22;--c2:#2b1d16;--x:41%;--y:57%\"></div><span class=\"zh\">酸辣汤</span><h3>Hot & sour soup</h3><span class=\"m\">30 min · Sichuan</span></a></div></section><script>(function(){var c=document.querySelectorAll(\".wk-chips button\");if(!c.length)return;c.forEach(function(b){b.onclick=function(){c.forEach(function(x){x.setAttribute(\"aria-pressed\",x===b)});var f=b.dataset.f;document.querySelectorAll(\".wk-card\").forEach(function(k){var t=parseInt(k.dataset.t,10),show=f===\"all\"||(f===\"quick\"&&t<30)||k.dataset.r===f;k.classList.toggle(\"hide\",!show)})}})})();</script>","recipe":"<section class=\"wk-sec\"><div class=\"wk-h\"><h1 style=\"font:400 clamp(34px,5vw,64px)/1.1 var(--f-head);color:var(--c-primary)\">麻婆豆腐 · Mapo tofu</h1></div><p style=\"font:400 18px/1.8 var(--f-body);max-width:56ch\">Silky tofu in a red, numbing sauce. The version you can make on a Tuesday, with one jar of doubanjiang.</p>\n<div class=\"wk-meta\"><div><b>10 min</b><span>Prep</span></div><div><b>15 min</b><span>Cook</span></div><div><b>Medium</b><span>Heat</span></div><div><b>Sichuan</b><span>Region</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"wk-rec\"><aside class=\"wk-ing\"><h3>Ingredients</h3><div class=\"wk-serv\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"wk-m\" aria-label=\"Fewer servings\">−</button><output><span id=\"wk-n\">2</span></output><button type=\"button\" id=\"wk-p\" aria-label=\"More servings\">+</button><span style=\"font:500 14px var(--f-body);color:var(--c-secondary)\">servings</span></div><ul id=\"wk-ul\"></ul></aside>\n<ol class=\"wk-steps\"><li><div><h3>Blanch the tofu</h3><p>Cut into 2 cm cubes. Simmer in salted water for 2 minutes to firm it up, then drain gently.</p></div></li><li><div><h3>Fry the base <span class=\"wk-heat\" aria-label=\"High heat\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i></span></h3><p>Brown the mince, then add doubanjiang and black beans and fry until the oil turns red.</p></div></li><li><div><h3>Simmer <span class=\"wk-heat\" aria-label=\"Medium heat\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i></i></span></h3><p>Add stock and tofu. Slide the pan rather than stir, so the cubes stay whole. Four minutes.</p></div></li><li><div><h3>Thicken and finish</h3><p>Pour in the slurry in two goes. Finish with ground Sichuan pepper and spring onion.</p></div></li></ol></div></section><script>(function(){var I=[{\"n\": \"Soft tofu\", \"q\": 400, \"u\": \"g\"}, {\"n\": \"Minced pork or beef\", \"q\": 100, \"u\": \"g\"}, {\"n\": \"Doubanjiang\", \"q\": 1.5, \"u\": \"tbsp\"}, {\"n\": \"Fermented black beans\", \"q\": 1, \"u\": \"tbsp\"}, {\"n\": \"Garlic cloves\", \"q\": 3, \"u\": \"\"}, {\"n\": \"Spring onions\", \"q\": 2, \"u\": \"\"}, {\"n\": \"Sichuan pepper, ground\", \"q\": 0.5, \"u\": \"tsp\"}, {\"n\": \"Stock\", \"q\": 150, \"u\": \"ml\"}, {\"n\": \"Cornflour slurry\", \"q\": 1, \"u\": \"tbsp\"}],ul=document.getElementById(\"wk-ul\"),o=document.getElementById(\"wk-n\");if(!ul)return;var s=2;function f(x){var r=Math.round(x*100)/100;var w=Math.floor(r),d=r-w,fr={.25:\"¼\",.5:\"½\",.75:\"¾\"};if(fr[d])return(w?w:\"\")+fr[d];return String(r)}function r(){o.textContent=s;ul.innerHTML=I.map(function(i,k){return\"<li><input type=checkbox id=wk-i\"+k+\"><label for=wk-i\"+k+\"><span>\"+i.n+\"</span><span class=q>\"+f(i.q*s/2)+\" \"+i.u+\"</span></label></li>\"}).join(\"\")}document.getElementById(\"wk-m\").onclick=function(){s=Math.max(1,s-1);r()};document.getElementById(\"wk-p\").onclick=function(){s=Math.min(12,s+1);r()};r()})();</script>","picker":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>What to eat today</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);font-weight:400\">今天吃什么？</h1><p class=\"lead\">Can't decide? Roll the dice, then cook it.</p></div></section><section class=\"wk-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"wk-pick\"><div class=\"wk-roll\" id=\"wk-out\" aria-live=\"polite\"><div class=\"zh\">？</div><div class=\"en\">Press the button</div><p>8 dishes · no repeats within a week</p></div><div><p style=\"font:400 18px/1.8 var(--f-body);max-width:40ch;margin-bottom:22px\">Each dish is tested for a weeknight: one pan, under 30 minutes, ingredients from a normal supermarket.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"wk-btn\" id=\"wk-roll\">摇一摇 · Roll</button> <a class=\"wk-btn o\" href=\"{{p:recipes}}\">Browse all</a></div></div></section><script>(function(){var P=[{\"zh\": \"麻婆豆腐\", \"en\": \"Mapo tofu\", \"d\": \"25 min · spicy · rice-friendly\"}, {\"zh\": \"番茄炒蛋\", \"en\": \"Tomato & egg\", \"d\": \"15 min · mild · kids love it\"}, {\"zh\": \"红烧肉\", \"en\": \"Red-braised pork\", \"d\": \"90 min · weekend · rich\"}, {\"zh\": \"清蒸鱼\", \"en\": \"Steamed fish\", \"d\": \"20 min · light · special\"}, {\"zh\": \"蒜蓉青菜\", \"en\": \"Garlic greens\", \"d\": \"10 min · side · quick\"}, {\"zh\": \"扬州炒饭\", \"en\": \"Fried rice\", \"d\": \"20 min · leftovers · all-in-one\"}, {\"zh\": \"酸辣汤\", \"en\": \"Hot & sour soup\", \"d\": \"30 min · warming\"}, {\"zh\": \"宫保鸡丁\", \"en\": \"Kung pao chicken\", \"d\": \"30 min · sweet-heat\"}],b=document.getElementById(\"wk-roll\"),o=document.getElementById(\"wk-out\");if(!b)return;var t;b.onclick=function(){var n=0;clearInterval(t);t=setInterval(function(){var p=P[Math.floor(Math.random()*P.length)];o.innerHTML=\"<div class=zh>\"+p.zh+\"</div><div class=en>\"+p.en+\"</div><p>\"+p.d+\"</p>\";if(++n>10)clearInterval(t)},90)}})();</script>","techniques":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Techniques</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);font-weight:400\">Techniques · 技法</h1></div></section><section class=\"wk-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"wk-tech\"><div><span class=\"zh\">滑</span><h3>Velveting</h3><p>Marinate sliced meat in egg white, cornflour and a splash of wine for a silky texture.</p></div><div><span class=\"zh\">爆</span><h3>Bao: high-heat flash fry</h3><p>Very hot wok, small batches, ninety seconds. Everything stays crisp.</p></div><div><span class=\"zh\">蒸</span><h3>Steaming</h3><p>Boil first, then lower in the food. Cover tight. Add 30 seconds for each extra centimetre.</p></div></div></section>","pantry":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>The pantry</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);font-weight:400\">The pantry · 调料</h1><p class=\"lead\">Eight bottles that make most of the recipes here.</p></div></section><section class=\"wk-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"wk-tech\"><div><span class=\"zh\">酱</span><h3>Light soy sauce</h3><p>For salt and savoury depth. Reach for this first.</p></div><div><span class=\"zh\">醋</span><h3>Chinkiang vinegar</h3><p>Dark, malty, gently sour. Dips and braises.</p></div><div><span class=\"zh\">酒</span><h3>Shaoxing wine</h3><p>Removes gaminess and adds fragrance.</p></div><div><span class=\"zh\">豆</span><h3>Doubanjiang</h3><p>Fermented chilli bean paste. Fry it in oil first.</p></div><div><span class=\"zh\">椒</span><h3>Sichuan pepper</h3><p>Numbing, citrusy. Toast and grind fresh.</p></div><div><span class=\"zh\">油</span><h3>Sesame oil</h3><p>A finishing drizzle, never for frying.</p></div></div></section>","about":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>About</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);font-weight:400\">About</h1></div></section><section class=\"wk-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div style=\"max-width:60ch;font:400 18px/1.9 var(--f-body)\"><p>Wok &amp; Steam began as a notebook of the dishes my mother cooked from memory. Every recipe here is cooked at least three times before it is written. Replace this with your own story and photo.</p></div></section>","faq":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>FAQ</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);font-weight:400\">FAQ</h1></div></section><section class=\"wk-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"faq\"><details open><summary>Do I need a carbon-steel wok?</summary><p>No. A wide frying pan works; a wok just helps with tossing.</p></details><details><summary>Can I substitute Shaoxing wine?</summary><p>Dry sherry is the closest. Use the same amount.</p></details><details><summary>Where do I buy doubanjiang?</summary><p>Any Asian grocery, or online. Look for \"Pixian\" on the label.</p></details></div></section>","privacy":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Privacy policy</b></div><h1 style=\"\">Privacy policy</h1></div></section><section class=\"wk-sec\" style=\"padding-top:20px\"><div class=\"prose\"><p>Replace with your privacy policy: what you collect, why, how long you keep it and how customers can ask for deletion.</p></div></section>","404":"<section class=\"wk-sec\" style=\"text-align:center;padding-top:clamp(60px,10vw,140px)\"><div class=\"wk-plate\" style=\"width:min(70%,260px)\"><div class=\"ring\"></div></div><h1 style=\"font:400 clamp(60px,12vw,130px)/1 var(--f-head);color:var(--c-accent);margin-top:18px\">404</h1><p style=\"margin:10px 0 26px;font:400 22px var(--f-head)\">这盘菜已经吃完了。</p><a class=\"wk-btn\" href=\"{{p:home}}\">Back to the kitchen</a></section>"}}